WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 11h: Ragnarok near the moon — Lunar Cry buildup
Duration: ~21 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Close-up of the Ragnarok's dragon-shaped head in space. Dark metallic hull, glowing eye, mechanical joints against the stars.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The Ragnarok flies past the moon. Dark crimson patches cover the lunar surface. Red engine lights trail behind the ship.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Through a recording HUD, the moon's surface swarms with red creatures. The entire visible terrain is infested.
